name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q12_2026-pilot'

question 'Which of the following examples shows an AI system being used in a way that aligns with ethical principles and human values?'

right 'A hospital uses an AI tool to flag medical scans that may need urgent attention, while trained doctors make all final diagnoses and treatment decisions.'
wrong 'A company uses AI to automatically deny loan applications from applicants whose names suggest a particular ethnicity.'
wrong 'A school uses AI to monitor all student messages and report any that contain certain words to school administrators without student knowledge.'
wrong 'A social media platform uses AI to maximize the time users spend on the app, regardless of the effect on users\' wellbeing.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

